{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志下","commonName":"历代志下","title":"历代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"686ce221582f699b247061de865d425af7f7a8470b8e24b68b4cadccf8f25efa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["圣殿的器具"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所罗门造了一座铜坛，长九米，宽九米，高四米半。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他又铸了一个圆形的铜海，高两米二，直径四米半，周长十三米半。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["铜海边缘下面有两圈牛的图案，每四十五厘米有十头牛，是跟铜海一起铸造的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["有十二头铜牛驮着铜海，三头向北，三头向西，三头向南，三头向东。铜海安在牛上，牛尾向内。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["铜海厚八厘米，边如杯边，又如百合花，容量为六万六千升。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他又造了十个盆，五个放右边，五个放左边，用来清洗献燔祭所用之物。但铜海只供祭司洗涤使用。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他照着所定的式样，造了十个金灯台放在殿里，五个在右边，五个在左边；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又造了十张桌子放在殿里，五张在右边，五张在左边；还造了一百个金碗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他又建了祭司院、大院及大院的门，门都包上铜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["铜海放在殿的右边，就是东南方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["户兰又造了锅、铲和碗。他为所罗门王完成了上帝殿里的工作。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["户兰所制造的有：两根柱子，两个碗状的柱冠，两个装饰柱冠的网子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["四百个安在网子上的石榴，每个网子上两行石榴，用来装饰碗状的柱冠；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["盆座及盆座上的盆；"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["铜海和铜海下面的十二头铜牛；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["锅、铲、肉叉及耶和华殿里的一切器具。这些都是巧匠户兰用磨亮的铜为所罗门王制造的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["这些都是照王的命令，在疏割和撒利但之间的约旦平原用泥模铸成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["所罗门制造的器具极多，铜的重量无法统计。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所罗门又为上帝的殿造了以下器具：金坛和放供饼的桌子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["按规定放在内殿前的纯金灯台和灯盏，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["灯台上的金花、灯盏、火钳、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["灯剪、碗、碟和火鼎。殿门和至圣所的门也是金的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}